# Milestone 35: Style on a Row (reference/common/styles.md and reference/components/table.md). Page of 200 × 300
# with margins of 20: page area of 160 × 260 from (20, 20). Lines of 12 (Size 10) and two columns of 80.
#   The total style gives Padding 6 (top and bottom) to each cell of the rows that declare it in their Row: a one-line
#   cell measures 12 + 12 = 24. The rows without the style measure 12.
#   Body: row 1, no style: 12 (y = 20); row 2, with the style: 24 (y = 32); row 3, no style: 12 (y = 56).
#   Footer rows: one row with the style, 24 (y = 68). The table measures 12 + 24 + 12 + 24 = 72.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 200
		Height: 300
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Mono
				Size: 10
		For style: total
			Box:
				Padding: 6 0
	Section:
		Table:
			Id: t
			Column sizes: * *
			Body:
				Row:
					Cell: a
					Cell: b
				Row:
					Style: total
					Cell: c
						Id: c
					Cell: d
						Id: d
				Row:
					Cell: e
					Cell: f
			Footer rows:
				Row:
					Style: total
					Cell: g
						Id: g
					Cell: h
						Id: h
